00w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater13.jpg?resize=240%2C242&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater13.jpg?resize=768%2C773&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shane_drinkwater/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater11.jpg?resize=680%2C687&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"687\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater11.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater11.jpg?resize=320%2C323&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater11.jpg?resize=600%2C606&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater11.jpg?resize=240%2C242&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater11.jpg?resize=768%2C776&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shane_drinkwater/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater9.jpg?resize=680%2C700&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"700\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater9.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater9.jpg?resize=320%2C330&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater9.jpg?resize=600%2C618&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater9.jpg?resize=240%2C247&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater9.jpg?resize=768%2C7