/03/shanedrinkwater3.jpg?resize=320%2C334&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater3.jpg?resize=600%2C627&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater3.jpg?resize=240%2C251&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater3.jpg?resize=768%2C803&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater3.jpg?resize=1470%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1470w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater3.jpg?w=1360&amp;ssl=1 1360w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shane_drinkwater/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater1.jpg?resize=680%2C703&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"703\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater1.jpg?w=1522&amp;ssl=1 1522w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater1.jpg?resize=320%2C331&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater1.jpg?resize=600%2C620&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater1.jpg?resize=240%2C248&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater1.jpg?resize=768%2C794&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater1.jpg?resize=1486%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1486w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater1.jpg?w=1360&amp;ssl=1 1360w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shane_drinkwater/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater10.jpg?resize=680%2C672&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"672\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater10.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater10.jpg?resize=320%2C316&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater10.jpg?resize=600%2C593&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater10.jpg?resize=240%2C237&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater10.jpg?resize=768%2C759&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shane_drinkwater/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater12.jpg?resize=680%2C695&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"695\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater12.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater12.jpg?resize=320%2C327&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater12.jpg?resize=600%2C614&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater12.jpg?resize=240%2C245&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater12.jpg?resize=768%2C785&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shane_drinkwater/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater6.jpg?resize=680%2C626&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"626\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater6.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater6.jpg?resize=320%2C294&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater6.jpg?resize=600%2C552&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater6.jpg?resize=240%2C221&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/shanedrinkwater6.jpg?resize=768%2C707&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p>Couple with Native artist Magaret Nazon’s <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2019/10/08/margaret-nazon-celestial-beadwork/\">stunning celestial beadwork</a>, then revisit Thomas Wright’s self-published and scrumptiously illustrated 1750 marvel <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2021/02/16/thomas-wright-original-theory/\"><em>An Original Theory or New Hypothesis of the Universe</em></a>.</p>\n<hr /><h3>donating = loving</h3><p>For seventeen years, I have been spending hundreds of hours and thousands of dollars each month composing <em>The Marginalian</em> (which <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2021/10/22/brain-pickings-becoming-the-marginalian/\">bore the outgrown name <em>Brain Pickings</em></a> for its first fifteen years). It has remained free and ad-free and alive thanks to patronage from readers. I have no staff, no interns, no assistant — a thoroughly one-woman labor of love that is also my life and my livelihood. If this labor makes your own life more livable in any way, please consider lending a helping hand with a <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/donate/\">donation</a>. Your support makes all the difference.</p>\n\n<hr />\n\n<h3>newsletter</h3>\n<p><em>The Marginalian</em> has a free weekly newsletter. It comes out on Sundays and offers the week’s most inspiring reading. Here’s <a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/brainpickings/janna-levin-rebecca-elson-anne-lamott-james-gleick\">what to expect</a>. Like? <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/newsletter/\">Sign up.</a></p>","author":"Maria Popova","siteTitle":"The Marginalian","siteHash":"052ac1be0de11784b9ef27664fbcf33da8263d0e7cb9c6e601ccd959f2d3aa78","entryHash":"7dda71e7d0bb10d4c3b4f1abcac38d65dd46d751fc2006ae52aeeb088b983b0a","category":"Sites"}